Allreads includes language presets ported from Lukaisu
(https://github.com/HugoFara/lukaisu), by HugoFara.

Lukaisu's preset source (webapp/js/shared/offline/local/language-presets.ts)
is released under the Unlicense, and its repository is MIT licensed.
The files in data/languages/ carry the split rules, word characters,
dictionary and translator templates from that source, adapted to TOML.
Lukaisu used the placeholder `lukaisu_term`; here it is `{term}`.

The TTS locales in data/languages/ were chosen by Allreads (not taken from
Lukaisu).

The sentence-end rules in crates/core/src/text/sentences.rs follow Lukaisu's
`findLatinSentenceEnd` (webapp/js/shared/offline/local/parser/sentence-end.ts,
Unlicense), rewritten in Rust. The test file
crates/core/tests/fixtures/lukaisu-parser-fixtures.json is copied unchanged
from Lukaisu (webapp-tests/offline/parser/parser-fixtures.json).
